  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "XC04111",
    "sub_id": "GH215",
    "scr_dup": "002",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>出席率佔 百分之十 作業成績佔百分之二十五 期中考試佔百分之二十 個人自願報告 (會在總成績斟酌加分) 期末考筆試佔百分之二十 個人或團體報告佔百分之二十五 Attendance (10%) Homework (25%) Mid-term exam (20%) Final exam (20%) Report (25%)</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "Besides the textbooks I offer, I would also give students other reference paper. They are also required to make presentations at least once before the end of the semester. Quizzs and take-home exams will also be given several times. The questions may include connections between complex ideas in order that they can think critically, make judgments, and develop solutions.",
    "course_pol": "會將不能用食物飲料等規則詳細告知學生，課堂上儘管翻書考試，也必須符合考試規定。若因故必須線上上課，也都要符合線上上課的規定，以維護公平性。",
    "course_pol_en": "Regular participation is essential. If you must miss a session, please notify me in advance when possible. Assignments submitted after the deadline may incur a deduction of 10% per day unless prior arrangements are made. We are committed to a respectful, inclusive learning space. Disruptive or discriminatory behavior will not be tolerated.",
    "course_rem": "希望各位同學能按授課進度完成各項學習任務，並能主動積極地參與各項學習活動、準時繳交作業，完成各項學習任務，並符合本課程的學習目標者，以獲得應得的成績。若您在學期間遇到學習上的困難，請email 給我或寄訊息到ilearn訊息欄，我會很快速地給予回應。",
    "course_rem_en": "This course is designed to support your learning—please reach out if you ever feel unsure, overwhelmed, or behind. Keep an eye on announcements, start assignments early, and ask questions as soon as they come up. We’re all here to learn together, and I’m happy to help.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>隨著網路科技的發展，容易造成學生學術誠信的行為而不自知。現今學生在學習、寫作、做報告的過程，只需要「複製」和「貼上」幾個簡單動作，所需要的資料很輕易地就可取得，複製文字及圖片更是容易。在本課程中，首先要求學生報告的基本概念，務必將資料來源清楚表列；其次，引用來源要標示清楚 ，註解也要盡量詳實。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>The act like Plagiarism, Cheating on exams, Unauthorized collaboration or any Misuse of AI tools (increasingly expected) will not be allowed.&nbsp;Unless otherwise specified, all assignments must be completed individually. If generative AI tools are allowed for certain assignments, the acceptable use and required disclosure will be defined in advance.&nbsp;Violations of the academic integrity policy will be reported and may result in penalties ranging from a grade reduction to failure of the assignment or course, in accordance with university procedures.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
